      "statement": "ADR-007 replaces the retired ≥5-absence rule with dropout on absences exceeding a floored 20% of the batch's `total_sessions` or on 3 consecutive unexcused absences, whichever trips first; the threshold is a program default with a nullable tenant override whose null inherits the program rule, and the old count column is dropped rather than cast.",
